---
// Results.astro
---

<section id="results" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Student Proof & Achievements
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Real Results Speak Louder Than Words
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        See how hard-working students from Samana, Patran, and nearby villages converted their aspirations into real visa stamps, 7.5+ IELTS bands, and airline cabin crew careers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Result Card 1: IELTS -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-xs font-bold">IELTS Academic</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">Recent Result</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">7.5 Bands</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">Overall Score</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "I struggled with speaking hesitation. The daily 1-on-1 speaking cabins at Smart Tutorials gave me the confidence to score an 8.0 in Speaking alone!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Harpreet Kaur</span>
          <span>Samana Campus</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Card 2: PTE -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 text-xs font-bold">PTE Academic</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">Computer Lab Prep</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">72 / 90</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">First Attempt</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "Practicing on exact PTE exam simulation software in their air-conditioned lab made the real test feel like just another mock test."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Gurjot Singh</span>
          <span>Patran Road, Samana</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Card 3: Canada Visa -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">Canada Study Visa</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">Approved in 24 Days</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Visa Granted</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">Ontario, Canada</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "They were 100% transparent with my college selection and fees. No hidden cuts or unnecessary document delays. Truly reliable team."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Manpreet Sharma</span>
          <span>Near Samana</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Card 4: Cabin Crew -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold">Aviation & Cabin Crew</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">Airline Placement</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Cabin Crew</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600">Domestic Airline</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "The grooming, etiquette training, and walk-in interview simulations taught me how to present myself with airline-grade professionalism."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Simranjeet Kaur</span>
          <span>Aviation Batch</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Card 5: UK Study Visa -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">UK Higher Education</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">CAS & Visa Approved</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Master's Admit</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">London, UK</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "They drafted a razor-sharp SOP tailored to my exact background and handled the financial documentation guidance with ease."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Navdeep Singh</span>
          <span>Samana</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Card 6: Computer & AI -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold">Computer & AI Tools</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">Certified Graduate</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Office Pro</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600">Excel + Tally + AI</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
            "I learned computer accounting and modern AI tools that helped me secure an accounts executive job right here in Patiala district."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Rohit Kumar</span>
          <span>DCA Batch</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
